<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 49,028 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 49,028 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 49,028 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 7 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Thursday compared to 86,094 tonnes in the same period on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>				    Thursday    Dec 25</p>
<p>    Export cargo		 3,577	11,609</p>
<p>    Import cargo		45,451	74,485</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, four ships sailed and five berthed. In the next 24 hours, four are expected to sail and nine are expected to arrive.</p>
</text>
